%3D%3D%3D5%3F%27count%20one%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D6%3F%27false%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D7%3F%27true%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D8%3F%27fixed%20reference%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D9%3F%27count%20reference%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D10%3F%27boolean%20reference%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D11%3F%27equal%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D12%3F%27remainder%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D13%3F%27division%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D14%3F%27count%20addition%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D15%3F%27fixed%20addition%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D16%3F%27fixed%20multiplication%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D17%3F%27conditional%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D18%3F%27binding%27%3Acode%3D%3D%3D19%3F%27source%20cast%27%3A%27%27%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20A%20complete%20finite%20source%20recurrence%20over%20the%20actual%20unsigned%20bit%20pattern.%0A%20%2A%20Fixed%20division%2Fremainder%20use%20positive%20two.%20Counts%20fit%20u32.%20Reversal%20prefixes%0A%20%2A%20never%20exceed%20the%20original%20width%3B%20no%20represented%20bit%20value%20enters%20binary64.%0A%20%2A%20Leading%20counts%20are%20the%20final%20matching%20run%20in%20least-to-most%20scanning%20order%3B%0A%20%2A%20trailing%20counts%20stop%20after%20the%20first%20mismatch.%20Every%20input%2Fstate%20value%20has%0A%20%2A%20one%20actual%20source%20binding.%20Hosts%20only%20project%20these%20terms%20into%20existing%20ASTs.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20method%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20bits%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20planRustIntegerBits%28method%2Cbits%29%7B%0A%20if%28%21acceptRustIntegerBitMethod%28method%29%7C%7C%21%5B8%2C16%2C32%2C64%2C128%5D.includes%28bits%29%29return%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%20const%20reverse%3Dmethod%3D%3D%3D%27reverse_bits%27%2Ctrailing%3Dmethod%3D%3D%3D%27trailing_zeros%27%7C%7Cmethod%3D%3D%3D%27trailing_ones%27%2Cleading%3Dmethod%3D%3D%3D%27leading_zeros%27%7C%7Cmethod%3D%3D%3D%27leading_ones%27%2Cones%3Dmethod.endsWith%28%27ones%27%29%3B%0A%20let%20plan%3D%5B0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C1%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C2%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C3%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C4%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C5%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C6%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C7%2C0%2